   "id": "lovechoice-109733@major-2019-07-03",
   "gameId": "lovechoice-109733",
   "displayName": "【Update】Bug fixed and difficulty adjusted",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2019-07-03T20:36:40.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "According to some players’ feedbacks, I adjust the level “Duet • Farewell” of the story “Love•Distance” as below:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "1. [Bug fixed] the white frame appear timing was wrong sometime",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "2. adjust the white frame appear timing for better experience",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "3. when player miss too much times, there will be a more obvious suggestion from our lovely Grace^_^",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Besides, the mini game in story 1 is a little easier now.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "What I designed is for delivering experience to players more than challenges. Hope these changes will help some of players^_^",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Ye@AkabaStudio",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
