    },
    {
     "title": "About the update",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "1.The update is for free, you just need to update the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "2.Before entering the 2nd Story, players have to clear at least 2 endings of the first story. We adjusted the saving file structure about this and try to use the Steam achievement data of player to fix their saving files.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "But there is still a chance that some player already finished the first story can’t enter the 2nd directly.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "So, we add a temporary backdoor: Pressing “c” and click on the 2nd story, you can play it without finishing the first one. However, we still highly recommend new player experience though the first story first.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "3.For now, the new story only support the language below",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "•Simplified Chinese",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "•Traditional Chinese",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "•English",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "•Japanese",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "The translations above is done by Ye@AkabaStudio. Other languages version will be done by lovely players. Sorry but please wait for a while.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "4.We make some music for the 2nd story, if you like them or want to support us. Please get the Original Sound Track 2 (DLC).",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "We are already working on the 3rd story, hope we won’t take too long this time(/ω＼)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
